# ⭐ OPIc Sample Answer - Day34

When I have free time, I'd rather stay home than go out.

The main reason is that I can relax much more comfortably at home.

For example, I usually listen to music, watch videos, or study something I'm interested in.

Another advantage is that I don't have to spend time traveling.

Compared with going out, staying home is also less expensive and more convenient.

Of course, I sometimes meet my friends when I want to socialize.

But when I need to recharge, I'd rather stay home than go out.

That's why staying home is my preferred way to spend my free time.
